<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Florida Progress raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Florida Progress raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it upgraded Florida Progress Corp to hold from sell.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Florida Progress gained one point to 31.</p>
<p>-- Florida Progress said Thursday it had reached an agreement in its request to recover costs of replacement fuel associated with the extended outage at its Crystal River Nuclear Plant.</p>
</text>
